 ## Background
-The method was proposed by Noordmans et al., who adopted the Kajiya and von Herzen two-pass algorithm for volumetric shadows and adapted the notion of opacity to a spectral representation [S1, book]. It is described in the context of local and global illumination in the volume rendering integral.
